# Known flaky failures

This is the single registry for the CI triage policy in AGENTS.md §5.
An entry is not proof that a new failure has the same cause. Match the exact
signature and platform. At most one CI rerun is permitted under the policy;
retain the original evidence. An isolated pass is provisional LOAD only on the
first occurrence. Recurrence requires causal investigation, not another LOAD
classification based solely on an isolated pass. Remove entries when their
issue is resolved; unexpected failures are not implicitly authorised for rerun.

